  "context": "# PayPal annual and quarterly disclosures\n\nc01:s01 - PayPal 2024 10-K - net revenue categories\n[[\"Total net revenues (2)\", \"$\", \"31,797\", \"$\", \"29,771\", \"$\", \"27,518\"], [\"Transaction revenues\", \"$\", \"28,842\", \"$\", \"26,857\", \"$\", \"25,206\"], [\"Revenues from other value added services\", \"2,955\", \"2,914\", \"2,312\"], [\"Total net revenues (2)\", \"$\", \"31,797\", \"$\", \"29,771\", \"$\", \"27,518\"]]\nUSD million. Columns: FY2024,FY2023,FY2022.\n\nc01:s02 - PayPal Q4 release - quarterly net revenue categories\n[[\"Transaction revenues\", \"$\", \"7,588\", \"$\", \"7,067\", \"$\", \"7,153\", \"$\", \"7,034\", \"$\", \"7,283\"], [\"Revenues from other value added services\", \"$\", \"778\", \"$\", \"780\", \"$\", \"732\", \"$\", \"665\", \"$\", \"743\"], [\"Total net revenues\", \"$\", \"8,366\", \"$\", \"7,847\", \"$\", \"7,885\", \"$\", \"7,699\", \"$\", \"8,026\"]]\nUSD million. Columns: quarters Dec2024,Sep2024,Jun2024,Mar2024,Dec2023.\n\nc01:s03 - PayPal FY2024 operating results\n[[\"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"], [\"Presented in millions, except per share data and percentages\", \"FY'24\", \"FY'23\", \"YoY Growth\", \"FXN YoY Growth\"], [\"Total payment volume\", \"1,681,150\", \"1,528,579\", \"10%\", \"10%\"], [\"GAAP\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"]]\nPresented in millions. FY2024 and FY2023. Nominal and FX-neutral growth columns are distinct.\n\nc01:s04 - PayPal Q4 operating results\n[[\"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"], [\"Presented in millions, except per share data and percentages\", \"4Q'24\", \"4Q'23\", \"YoY Growth\", \"FXN YoY Growth\"], [\"Total payment volume\", \"$437,836\", \"$409,832\", \"7%\", \"7%\"], [\"GAAP\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"]]\nPresented in millions. Q4FY2024 and Q4FY2023.\n\nc01:s05 - PayPal 2024 10-K - revenue geography\n[[\"U.S.\", \"$\", \"18,267\", \"$\", \"17,253\", \"$\", \"15,807\"], [\"Other countries (1)\", \"13,530\", \"12,518\", \"11,711\"]]\nUSD million. Columns FY2024,FY2023,FY2022. Geography is primarily based on merchant or consumer billing location.\n\nc01:s06 - PayPal key metric definitions\nTPV is the value of payments, net of payment reversals, successfully completed on the platform or enabled by partner solutions, excluding gateway-exclusive transactions. Transaction revenues comprise net transaction fees and other fees such as currency conversion. Other value added services include partnerships, interest and credit fees, referrals, subscriptions and gateway services. Active accounts can include multiple accounts per user.\n\nc01:s07 - PayPal revenue drivers\nThe source reports that transaction revenue growth was lower than TPV growth in 2024 primarily due to changes in merchant mix, with higher volume from large merchants having lower pricing. Both metrics concern the consolidated platform and are annual flows. The aggregate ratio does not identify any individual contract rate.\n\n## Data dictionary\nperiod_end and months identify the economic period. amount and unit preserve the displayed precision. category and metric retain source headings. Section IDs identify source locations. Nominal USD amounts have not been adjusted for exchange rates. Geography is a separate disaggregation, not additional revenue.",
